`ProbComp.abs_expect_sub_le_expect`: `(∀ x, |f x - g x| ≤ h x) → |𝔼_c f - 𝔼_c g| ≤ 𝔼_c h`, the
statement and proof of the private ETT copy (`EncryptThenTag/Forgery.lean:515`), which the DL-40
cleanup re-points to it. Pure insertions: the lemma after `abs_expect_sub_le` and its
`## Main results` bullet.

